Z||000004||Turbo1dr||04-06-2001||12:34 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jules:<BR><B>   I get ideas like that from the bastards that want to charge $50/hour who are supposed to be able to actually FIX IT, the right way.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks for calling Auto Technicians like myself "Bastards".  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">   I'd really like to help you get your car fixed but I don't seem to be as knowledgeable as you. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>------------------<BR>86 SE Fiero converted to GT (Buick Turbo V6 transplant in progress)<P><B>78 Malibu</B> 3.8L Turbo Buick<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/Malibu/Homex.html" TARGET=_blank>TURBO WONDER</A><BR>Best 8th: 1.548, 6.62@106.32  3450lb<BR>TE-70 3 bolt, Ported Stock Iron Heads and Intake<BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/turbowonder/Malibu/Modifications_files/Intercooler.jpg" TARGET=_blank>2.5 stock intercoolers</A><BR>Vernon Swindell, Jr.||||reg||8
